<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sierra Health said cut at DLJ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sierra Health said cut at DLJ.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette cut its rating of Sierra Health Services Inc to a market perform from its prior rating of buy, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- Sierra Health has a target price of $32 at DLJ.</p>
<p>-- DLJ maintained 1996 and 1997 estimates and said the stock was likely to remain weak, along with the rest of the health maintenance organization (HMO) group.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-1/2 to 27-1/2.</p>
</text>
